WEBVTT

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:04.354
and, if you would like, in neurosciences.

00:14:04.354 --> 00:14:08.354
All of that, it is not done 
in a very conventional way,

00:14:08.354 --> 00:14:11.219
it's done in a very multidisciplinary way,

00:14:11.219 --> 00:14:16.984
where you have the ICT engaged 
with biomedical, and so forth.

00:14:16.984 --> 00:14:23.197
So you are trying to create research teams
that are really multidisciplinary,

00:14:23.439 --> 00:14:26.643
so they can support 
and enhance each other's work.

00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:32.033
So the idea is really to have that focus,
so you can really contribute